<title>INDIA: India 91-day t-bill yield unchanged at 6.77 pct.</title>
<headline>India 91-day t-bill yield unchanged at 6.77 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it has maintained the cut-off rate at 98.34 rupees at the weekly auction of 91-day treasury bills.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was steady 6.77 percent.</p>
<p>RBI said the issue had been fully subscribed.</p>
<p>--</p>
